\n                       Defendants.\n20\n\n21\n\n22\n\n23\n\n24\n\n25\n\n26\n\n27\n\n28\n\n\n                    DECLARATION OF YOON-WOO NAM IN SUPPORT OF DEFENDANT\u2019S NOTICE OF REMOVAL\n     318911701v.1\n\f              Case 3:25-cv-06024-TSH          Document 1-1       Filed 07/17/25      Page 2 of 2\n\n\n\n 1            I, Yoon Woo Nam, declare as follows:\n\n 2            1.     I am a partner with the law firm of Seyfarth Shaw LLP, counsel for Defendant The Hertz\n\n 3   Corporation (\u201cHertz\u201d) in the above-entitled matter. I am admitted to practice law in the State of\n\n 4   California and before this Court. I am one of the attorneys representing Hertz in this action.\n\n 5            2.     I make this declaration based on my personal knowledge, except as to those matters\n\n 6   stated on information and belief, and as to those matters, I believe them to be true. If called as a witness\n\n 7   to do so, I could and would testify competently thereto.\n\n 8            3.     On June 16, 2025, Plaintiff served Hertz with a copy of the Summons and Complaint.\n\n 9            4.     On July 16, 2025, Hertz filed its Answer to the State Court Action in the Alameda\n\n10   County Superior Court.\n\n11            5.     Defendant has not filed or received any other pleadings or papers in this action, other\n\n12   than the pleadings described in Exhibit 1 to the Notice of Removal. There are no pending hearings\n\n13   currently scheduled in the Alameda County Superior Court in the State Court Action besides the initial\n\n14   case management conference on November 12, 2025.\n\n15            6.     Based on my experience, attorneys\u2019 fees in employment cases often exceed $75,000.\n\n16   Defendant anticipates that the Parties will propound written discovery, that depositions will be taken in\n\n17   this case, and that Defendant will file a Motion for Summary Judgment or Partial Summary Judgment. It\n\n18   is more likely than not that the fees in this case will exceed $75,000 through discovery and a summary\n\n19   judgment hearing, and the fees would certainly exceed $75,000 if the case proceeds to trial.\n\n20            I declare under penalty of perjury that the foregoing is true and correct. Executed on this 16th\n\n21   day of July, 2025 in Sacramento, California.\n\n22\n                                                    /s/ Yoon-Woo Nam\n23                                                  Yoon-Woo Nam\n24\n\n25\n\n26\n\n27\n\n28\n                                                          2\n                     DECLARATION OF YOON-WOO NAM IN SUPPORT OF DEFENDANT\u2019S NOTICE OF REMOVAL\n     318911701v.1\n\f", "ocr_status": 2, "date_upload": "2025-07-17T13:35:42.403828-07:00", "document_number": "1", "attachment_number": 1, "pacer_doc_id": "035025973353", "is_available": true, "is_free_on_pacer": null, "is_sealed": null, "document_type": 2, "description": "", "acms_document_guid": ""}], "date_created": "2025-07-17T03:33:49.947193-07:00", "date_modified": "2025-07-17T13:34:40.698111-07:00", "date_filed": "2025-07-17", "time_filed": "00:14:14", "entry_number": 1, "recap_sequence_number": "2025-07-17.005", "pacer_sequence_number": 4, "description": "Answer to Removal Complaint attached as Exhibit 2 to the Notice of Removal by The Hertz Corporation. (dhm, COURT STAFF) (Filed on 7/17/2025) (Entered: 07/17/2025)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/431674175/", "id": 431674175, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/70817620/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/445985826/", "id": 445985826, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "/docket/70817620/2/henry-v-the-hertz-corporation/", "date_created": "2025-07-17T03:33:49.190119-07:00", "date_modified": "2025-07-17T13:34:40.580048-07:00", "sha1": "", "page_count": null, "file_size": null, "filepath_local": null, "filepath_ia": "", "ia_u